## Dead / bug (verified — remove or fix, NOT deploy knobs)

| Verdict | Var | Finding |
|---|---|---|
| ☠️ | `SLAYZONE_SERVER_PORT` | `getServerPort()` defined + barrel-exported, zero callers. Superseded by SLAYZONE_PORT → remove var+helper |
| ☠️ | `SLAYZONE_MCP_HOST` | Only written to docker/ssh child env; no reader (CLI hardcodes 127.0.0.1). No-op → remove 2 write lines |
| ☠️ | `SLAYZONE_RUNNERS_ENABLED` | Only set in one test; never read in prod. Hub always runs gateway → remove from test |
| ☠️ | `SLAYZONE_HOOK_NAME` | Not an env var — JS `const='slayzone-notify'`. Mis-catalogued → drop from list |
| 🐛 | `SLAYZONE_AGENT_MODE` | 1 reader (`cliAuthor()`), 0 setters → CLI artifacts always tag `user`. Likely should read SLAYZONE_AGENT_ID |
| 🐛 | `SLAYZONE_DB_DIR` ↔ `STORE_DIR` | Precedence inverted: hub `STORE_DIR ?? DB_DIR`, artifacts `DB_DIR ‖ STORE_DIR` → split dirs if both set |

## Not operator-facing (code stays, omit from deploy docs)

- **Machine-injected per-run** (agent/hooks/session): `SLAYZONE_HUB_TOKEN` (per-task bearer, ≠ JOIN_TOKEN), `SLAYZONE_AGENT_HOOK_URL`, `SLAYZONE_AGENT_ID`, `SLAYZONE_SESSION_ID`, `SLAYZONE_PROJECT_ID`, `SLAYZONE_TASK_ID`, `SLAYZONE_MCP_PORT`
- **Fork sidecar only:** `SLAYZONE_RUNTIME_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_HOST_CAP_URL`, `SLAYZONE_HOST_REST_URL` (supervised host bridge)
- **e2e-only:** `SLAYZONE_USER_DATA_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_BOOT_LOG_PATH`, `SLAYZONE_E2E_ALLOW_RUNNER`, `SLAYZONE_E2E_INSTALL_HOOKS`, `*_SETTINGS_PATH`/`*_HOOKS_PATH`/`OPENCODE_PLUGIN_PATH` (test redirects)
- **Dev/build:** `SLAYZONE_DEV`, `SLAYZONE_REACT_DEV`, `SLAYZONE_PROFILE`, `SLAYZONE_CHROMIUM_PROD`, `SLAYZONE_DEBUG_BOOT`, `SLAYZONE_REGISTER_DEV_PROTOCOL`, `SLAYZONE_SIDECAR_HOT_RESTART`, `SLAYZONE_SHELL_DEV_SERVER`, `SLAYZONE_DISABLE_CLONEFILE`, `SLAYZONE_GC_*`, `*__` (build-time esbuild/vite defines: `SERVER_BUILT_AT__`, `SERVER_COMMIT__`, `CHROMIUM_PROD__`, `PROFILE__`)

**Home-anchored (bold) = the 4 this task retargets to CWD:** `SLAYZONE_HOME_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_STORE_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CREDENTIALS_DIR` (+ raw-homedir credential-store gap).
